* Auto-generated testbench for regulator feedback: U201
* Divider: R201/R202, ratio=0.0999
* Expected Vout=3.3V, Vfb=0.3297V (Vref=0.6V)
* Topology: standard
* Model: ideal passives (exact for DC divider)

VIN out_rail 0 DC 3.3
R201 out_rail fb_net 100k
